  "body": "Space, style and effortless living all in one! Positioned on a sunny 312m² (more or less) corner site in Strathmill, Orewa, this beautifully designed, brand-new brick-and-tile home offers the perfect blend of modern comfort and everyday practicality. From the designer kitchen with butler's pantry to the ambient ceiling lighting, built-in\r\nspeakers and two outdoor decks, every detail has been thoughtfully considered. With four generous bedrooms, a spacious single-level layout and quality finishes throughout, this is a home the whole family will love.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  4 spacious bedrooms and 2 stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Single-level brick-and-tile construction with modern street appeal\r\n•  Sunny 312m² (more or less) corner site offering excellent natural light\r\n•  Designer kitchen with quality appliances and a separate butler's pantry\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan living and dining with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n•  Two decks at the front and rear, perfect for relaxing and entertaining\r\n•  Master bedroom featuring a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite\r\n•  Underfloor heating in both bathrooms for added warmth and comfort\r\n•  Ambient ceiling lighting and built-in speakers adding a touch of modern luxury\r\n•  CCTV security system with multiple outdoor cameras and convenient smartphone monitoring\r\n•  Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n•  Separate laundry for added everyday convenience\r\n•  Pre-wiring for future EV charger installation\r\n•  Title and CCC issued – ready to move in!\r\n•  Handy to Orewa Beach, schools, shops and cafés\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
